          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of a luminous phenomenon in the sky and then on photographs: direct observation of a parhelion, and flares on photos a posteriori.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "307f9261c8a7517156df15d3803690ef3136ab7c168c99dd392b0ab33d00b033"
        },
        {
